      "heading": "‘Verity’: trash, but not good trash",
      "films": [
        {
          "title": "Verity",
          "year": 2026,
          "note": "Colleen Hoover adaptation (Hathaway, Johnson, Hartnett), dir. Michael Showalter. At war with its source: campy winks undercut by a faithful ‘it was a writing exercise’ twist and a flat ending. Expensive and well-designed, but no fun. C CinemaScore."
        },
        {
          "title": "It Ends with Us",
          "year": 2024,
          "note": "First Hoover adaptation; the Lively/Baldoni fiasco."
        },
        {
          "title": "Regretting You",
          "year": 2025,
          "note": "Called, drily, the funniest movie of 2025."
        },
        {
          "title": "Reminders of Him",
          "year": 2026,
          "note": "Earlier-2026 Hoover entry; Maika Monroe, Tyriq Withers."
        },
        {
          "title": "The Idea of You",
          "year": 2024,
          "note": "Showalter/Hathaway literary adaptation; the sincere romance ‘Verity’ isn't."
        },
        {
          "title": "Gone Girl",
          "year": 2014,
          "note": "The diary-as-portal structure ‘Verity’ mirrors, badly."
        },
        {
          "title": "The Housemaid",
          "year": 2025,
